# ARMORY FAMILY organic loop (screens 0x17 / 0x0a / 0x0d) — s32.
# Menu→load prefix (title → single player → load → lastturn → confirm),
# then on the loaded strategic map:
#   1. ARMORY tab (county-action strip rec0, screen (478..511,430..459),
#      FUN_0043ae30 param 1, owner-gated) → the army create/change overlay
#      (screen 0x17) over the armoury backdrop.
#   2. Conscription slider: track click at game (216,184) → pct 20 (the
#      track is an LMB-held drag target; y 184 lands in the track band in
#      BOTH create (0xb0..0xe0) and change (0x90..0xc0) modes), then one
#      left-arrow press (150,184) → pct 19.
#   3. RMB → the ARMORY VIEW (screen 0x0a) with the muster pool re-seeded
#      from the pct-19 conscripts (FUN_004aa90a).
#   4. Tally box 3 (237..310, 396..480) = weapon 4 (owned in lastturn.sav;
#      weapons 1/2 have zero stock — a first run proved the stock gate
#      holds identically on both engines) → the ASSIGN overlay (0x0d).
#   5. Two +1 gauntlet presses (272..304, 48..80) — move 2 men to weapon 4.
#   6. Tally box 5 (387..461) = weapon 5: weapon switch → triggers the
#      troop MARCH for weapon 4 (it gained men) + re-renders 0x0d for
#      weapon 5.
#   7. RMB → back to the 0x0a view (the march keeps playing there).
#   8. CREATE label (542..634, 396..424) → FUN_00435b4d commit: spawns the
#      army via engine_combat_spawn_unit (or posts the reject scroll —
#      auto_dismiss clears it) and closes to the strategic map.
